    {
      "type": "ascii",
      "start": 3887,
      "end": 4239,
      "text": "    The 3050 Record Sheet book for the 1S does not show ferro-fibrous or endo steel, even though the 2750 TRO showed the design had them. Therefore, FF and ES crits are added to this design, as indicated in the 3050 Record Sheet book for the 3S version, which also had both FF and ES. It is assumed that the 3050 book is in error in the case of the 1S."
    },
